---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Collator: One vault. Your entire estate."
description: "Collator is a private digital estate vault for Indian families. Documents, assets, policies and people, organised on your device. No cloud. No accounts."
ogTitle: "Collator: One vault. Your entire estate."
ogDescription: "A private vault for documents, assets, policies and people. Everything stored on your device. No cloud, no accounts."
ogUrl: "https://collator.app"
ctaHref: "#download"
---
<!-- Hero -->
<section class="bg-navy pt-14">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 w-full">

    <div class="md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16 md:items-center md:py-20">

      <!-- Text -->
      <div class="pt-12 pb-8 md:pt-0 md:pb-0">
        <h1 class="font-serif font-normal text-white leading-[1.08] text-[3.5rem] md:text-[4.5rem] mb-6">One vault.<br>Your entire<br>estate.</h1>
        <p class="text-[#C8D6E4] text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed mb-8 md:max-w-sm">Documents, assets, policies and people, organised the way you think. A calm, private place for everything your family would need to find.</p>

        {% include "partials/download-buttons.njk" %}
      </div>

      <!-- Desktop app preview: right column -->
      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="w-[252px] aspect-[9/19.5] rounded-[38px] border-2 border-white/10 bg-white/[.03] overflow-hidden">
          <video class="block w-full h-full object-cover rounded-[36px]" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/assets/video/hero-demo-poster.jpg">
            <source src="/assets/video/hero-demo.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Mobile app preview: below text, large, bleeds off screen -->
    <div class="md:hidden flex justify-center pt-4">
      <div class="w-[72vw] max-w-[300px] aspect-[9/19.5] rounded-[2.5rem] border-2 border-white/15 bg-white/[.05] overflow-hidden">
        <video class="block w-full h-full object-cover rounded-[2.4rem]" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/assets/video/hero-demo-poster.jpg">
          <source src="/assets/video/hero-demo.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- Problem -->
<section class="bg-canvas py-20 px-6 md:px-8">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-serif font-normal text-[2.25rem] leading-[1.15] mb-6 text-ink">Everything important,<br>scattered everywhere.</h2>
      <p class="text-dim text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed opacity-70">Wills, policies, property papers and bank accounts sit in different drawers, apps and heads. Most families discover the chaos only when they need answers most.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="pb-6 border-b-2 border-dashed border-inset">
        <p class="font-serif font-normal text-[3rem] leading-none text-ink">&#8377;2 lakh<br>crore</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm mt-2 leading-snug"><a href="https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2244475&reg=3&lang=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-saffron-deep transition-colors underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4">lost to families every year, simply unclaimed.</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-6">
        <p class="font-serif font-normal text-[3rem] leading-none text-ink">3 to 6<br>months</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm mt-2 leading-snug"><a href="https://cleartax.in/s/succession-certificate-format" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-saffron-deep transition-colors underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4">for a succession certificate when no nominee was named.</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Features -->
<section class="bg-tint border-y border-hair py-20 px-6 md:px-8">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="font-serif font-normal text-[2.25rem] leading-[1.15] mb-12 text-ink">Organised the way you think.</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4">

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-5 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "file-text", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[.875rem] text-ink mb-2">Documents and IDs</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.8125rem] leading-relaxed">Aadhaar, PAN, passport, policies, deeds, wills.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-5 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "landmark", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[.875rem] text-ink mb-2">Assets and investments</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.8125rem] leading-relaxed">Property, vehicles, deposits, mutual funds, PPF.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-5 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "users", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[.875rem] text-ink mb-2">People and advisors</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.8125rem] leading-relaxed">Family, and the doctor, CA, lawyer who help.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-5 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "lock", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[.875rem] text-ink mb-2">Custody</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.8125rem] leading-relaxed">Where every physical original is kept.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-5 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "share-2", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[.875rem] text-ink mb-2">Succession</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.8125rem] leading-relaxed">Wills, nominees, and the gaps between them.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/promise-section.njk" %}

<!-- Pricing -->
<section class="bg-canvas py-20 px-6 md:px-8">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-serif font-normal text-[2.25rem] leading-[1.15] mb-5 text-ink">Try free. Pay once.<br>Own forever.</h2>
      <p class="text-dim text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed opacity-70">Use it free during the trial. After that, new records need a single lifetime purchase. Viewing, editing, import and export stay free, always.</p>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/pricing-card.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
